<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Applebee's raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Applebee's raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Interstate/Johnson Lane said it upgraded Applebee's International Inc to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 earnings estimate to $1.58 per share from $1.56, citing company's slightly stronger than expected second quarter earnings.</p>
<p>-- Set 1998 estimate at $1.92 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3/16 to 26-13/16.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
